  "protocol": "E2-Full jointly trains all five public domains with one shared RawMamba. It inherits the E1 RawMamba model and all optimizer/scheduler hyperparameters from raw_mamba_xjtu.json; the only training override is validation domain-macro RMSE for checkpoint selection. XJTU, MIT, and each SmartHealth family retain their E1 split, raw adapter, fixed physical normalization, and SOH target definition. SmartHealth targets are calibration-derived label_capacity_Ah divided by the fixed 40 Ah or 280 Ah family nominal capacity; per-series Q_ref remains provenance only. The launcher runs a read-only readiness check for every source E1 configuration before launching any seed, and a split marked manual_confirmation_required remains a hard stop."
